The first symbolic attempt exposed a genuine semantics issue, not a contract issue: K’s symbolic map lookup stayed opaque after the digit assignment, so the first conditional could not fire. I’m replacing that implementation detail with an explicit shadowing environment whose lookup equations reduce symbolically.
